{"v":4,"catch":"使用強大的 BLASTER HEAD 武器進行反擊！","desc":"《GAPLUS》是NAMCO （Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.) 於1984年發行的射擊遊戲。\n正如標題“GAPLUS”所暗示的那樣，來自 GALAGA 的所有車輛都回來了並啟動了！\n偷回一個爆破頭並發動反擊！ 現在是銀河系終極戰士出現的時候了！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-04-21","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4999023107377263bd9cc9a7d429ac76dccf63b2139dd41de577be543dc391c1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f53fb6d2972426af6128dfe5bc152dc86958c926b9bc295719d793dcb3715c6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/60e307ad4ae61dc12f976c6648ae33b9b2bf2042268a533bb1b30d241719e5d2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0c70182b19e305d86a4059df83284a245823d0dfe889558876c7320723511fa2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d04bce8c2478bf55f59add86f9dfa2ef221651edde1f83eca063f4a1b1d92b6f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac999d878fce6f2c21ce276215eaafc536050d3dfdc004101c524c517e24c261.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e5b0178e6000","dlc":[]}